[49.411907, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython - <<'EOF'\r\nimport json\r\nd=json.load(open('/app/data/train.json'))\r\nfor x in d[10:14]:\r\n    print(x['question'])\r\n    for o in x['options']: print(' ',o)\r\n    print('ANS',x['answer'],'few',x.get('is_few_shot'))\r\n    print()\r\nEOF\r\nWhich three main topics are covered in the exhibits mentioned in the text?\r\n  A. Geology, Phylogeny, and Evolutionary Thought\r\n  B. Phylogeny, Geologic Time, and Special Exhibits\r\n  C. Evolutionary Thought, Geologic Time, and Phylogeny\r\n  D. Phylogeny, Special Exhibits, and Evolutionary Thought\r\nANS B few 0\r\n\r\nWhich factor contributes to the production of the right amount of variation in sexual reproduction for natural selection to act upon?\r\n  A. The size of the population.\r\n  B. The degree of inbreeding versus outbreeding.\r\n  C. The amount of exchange of parts of chromosomes (crossing over).\r\n  D. The mutation (gene change) rate.\r\nANS C few 0\r\n\r\nAccording to the text, which three key organizational components do the best organizations consider when evaluating and im"]
[49.411998, "o", "plementing new policies and procedures?\r\n  A. People, performance, and policies.\r\n  B. Context, change, and competence.\r\n  C. Knowledge, skills, and resources.\r\n  D. Employees, surroundings, and habits.\r\nANS B few 0\r\n\r\nWhich department in the text is dedicated to studying the post-transcriptional mechanisms of gene expression and various aspects of RNA biology?\r\n  A. Department of Microbiome Science\r\n  B. Department of Biochemistry\r\n  C. Department of Protein Evolution\r\n  D. Department of Nematode Biology\r\nANS B few 0\r\n"]
[49.454792, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mpython - <<'EOF'\r\nimport json\r\nfor f in ['train','val']:\r\n    d=json.load(open(f'/app/data/{f}.json'))\r\n    lens=[]\r\n    for x in d:\r\n        s=x['question']+'\\n'+'\\n'.join(x['options'])\r\n        lens.append(len(s))\r\n    lens.sort()\r\n    print(f, 'chars min/med/max', lens[0], lens[len(lens)//2], lens[-1])\r\n    # option length stats vs correct\r\n    import statistics\r\n    longest_correct=sum(1 for x in d if max(x['options'], key=len)==x['options'][ord(x['answer'])-65])\r\n    print('longest correct', longest_correct/len(d))\r\nEOF\r\ntrain chars min/med/max 104 258 1288\r\nlongest correct 0.35333333333333333\r\nval chars min/med/max 94 265 736\r\nlongest correct 0.44\r\n"]
[50.539616, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[59.881864, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /app && python - <<'EOF'\r\nfrom transformers import AutoTokenizer\r\ntok=AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained('openai-community/gpt2')\r\nprint('A ids', tok.encode(' A'), 'B', tok.encode(' B'), 'C', tok.encode(' C'), 'D', tok.encode(' D'))\r\nprint(tok.encode('Answer:'))\r\nimport json\r\nfor f in ['train','val']:\r\n d=json.load(open(f'/app/data/{f}.json'))\r\n ls=[]\r\n for x in d:\r\n  p='Question: '+x['question']+'\\n'+'\\n'.join(x['options'])+'\\nAnswer:'\r\n  ls.append(len(tok(p).input_ids))\r\n ls.sort()\r\n print(f, ls[0], ls[len(ls)//2], ls[int(len(ls)*.9)], ls[-1])\r\nEOF\r\nA ids [317] B [347] C [327] D [360]\r\n[33706, 25]\r\ntrain 34 67 122 224\r\nval 36 68 118 168\r\n"]
